{"content":[{"id":"392b0beb","settings":{"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"4c08148"}]},"elements":[{"id":"f9f71f6","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null,"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"3cb9aa0"}]},"elements":[{"id":"7a39c4f5","settings":{"title":"Accessibility Statement For Magnolia Air","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"2796abb"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"40e621e8","settings":{"editor":"<p>This is an accessibility statement for Magnolia Air.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"901b0d8"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"46e96fb8","settings":{"title":"Measures To Support Accessibility\n","header_size":"h3","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"3a35e51"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"4b659c72","settings":{"editor":"<p>Magnolia Air takes the following measures to ensure the accessibility of <a href=\"http:\/\/moesalley.com\">magnoliaairllc.com<\/a>:<\/p><ul><li>Include accessibility as part of our mission statement.<\/li><li>Include accessibility throughout our internal policies.<\/li><li>Integrate accessibility into our procurement practices.<\/li><li>Provide continual accessibility training for our staff.<\/li><li>Assign clear accessibility goals and responsibilities.<\/li><li>Employ formal accessibility quality assurance methods.<\/li><\/ul>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"72006db"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"3a67033f","settings":{"title":"Conformance Status\n","header_size":"h3","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"105dc2b"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"60d631e","settings":{"editor":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/WAI\/standards-guidelines\/wcag\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG)<\/a> defines requirements for designers and developers to improve accessibility for people with disabilities. It defines three levels of conformance: Level A, Level AA, and Level AAA. Magnolia Air is partially conformant with WCAG 2.1 level AA. Partially conformant means that some parts of the content do not fully conform to the accessibility standard.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"02f552c"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"7ce0dac0","settings":{"title":"Feedback\n","header_size":"h3","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"794258d"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"74f47bfa","settings":{"editor":"<p>We welcome your feedback on the accessibility of Magnolia Air. Please let us know if you encounter accessibility barriers on Magnolia Air:<\/p><ul><li>Phone: <a href=\"tel:318-233-9318\">+1 (318) 233-9318<\/a><\/li><li>E-mail: <a href=\"mailto:magnoliaair@outlook.com\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">magnoliaair@outlook.com<\/span><\/a><\/li><li>Postal Address: 17399 Highway 167, Dry Prong, LA, 71423 <\/li><\/ul><p><strong>We try to respond to feedback within 2 business days.<\/strong><\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"fa51850"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"72b5644d","settings":{"title":"Technical Specifications\n","header_size":"h3","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"1bcb473"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"4ff31ad2","settings":{"editor":"<p>Accessibility of Magnolia Air relies on the following technologies to work with the particular combination of web browser and any assistive technologies or plugins installed on your computer:<\/p><ul><li>HTML<\/li><li>CSS<\/li><li>JavaScript<\/li><\/ul><p>These technologies are relied upon for conformance with the accessibility standards used.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"15bd4de"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"591ab49f","settings":{"title":"Limitations And Alternatives\n","header_size":"h3","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"f071f9f"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"1e31ecfc","settings":{"editor":"<p>Despite our best efforts to ensure the accessibility of Magnolia Air, there may be some limitations. Below is a description of known limitations, and potential solutions. Please contact us if you observe an issue not listed below.<\/p><p><strong>Known limitations for Magnolia Air:<\/strong><\/p><ol><li><strong>Comments from Users:<\/strong> Uploaded images may not have text alternatives because we cannot ensure the quality of contributions. We monitor user comments and typically repair issues within 10 business days. Please email us and let us know about the issue if you encounter an issue.<\/li><li><strong>Archived Documents:<\/strong> Might not work with current assistive technologies because they use outdated technologies that do not support accessibility. We convert documents to new formats upon request within 3 business days. Please contact <a href=\"mailto:magnoliaair@outlook.com\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">magnoliaair@outlook.com<\/span><\/a>\u00a0for support.<\/li><\/ol>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"5ff2017"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"3a238dbd","settings":{"title":"Assessment Approach\n","header_size":"h3","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"0c2c8b4"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"68e15a1f","settings":{"editor":"<p>Magnolia Air assessed the accessibility of Magnolia Air by the following approaches:<\/p><ul><li>Self-evaluation<\/li><\/ul>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"369466c"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"column"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"section"}],"settings":{"template":"default"},"metadata":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","theme-transparent-header-meta":"default","site-post-title":"disabled","ast-title-bar-display":"disabled","ast-featured-img":"disabled","site-content-layout":"page-builder","wpil_sync_report3":"1","wpil_links_inbound_internal_count":"0","wpil_links_inbound_internal_count_data":"eJxLtDKwqq4FAAZPAf4=","wpil_links_outbound_internal_count":"3","wpil_links_outbound_internal_count_data":"eJztUU1PwzAM\/StTTiA0trSMDe\/CD+DjyDHK0miz5sZVmgoQ2n\\/efNKcqjMR8F\/6ZFxb9Fv9ui3SsQIZa9","wpil_links_outbound_external_count":"2","wpil_links_outbound_external_count_data":"eJzVUbtuwzAM\/BVDUzs0jpP0xUxBhqBAH0sBj4IsCTYRWTIkGW4Q5N9L202QNlO7dePjeEceBcxgjzBdvkF2Cyxv0PAXp7Thz2i3DLI57APcAzOUclRs2YMDzIG13jCKZlNgVYwNpGntdBDG6N1EurrvLajlQuxDImIX\/QdgaKP2VhBVMRDTSDOMvFJyB0xYWTk\/MBC6FqV1BoVAb4w80vSbC6W04sWON6Yt0R7paMY4KSI62yPpEOlI0cbj6sNdXYWh0Z5Lr0XUpyOzjPYLXLTR9bDzcvRCbtGWZ5b05dqp1mj+DT37EhmEP+JYPyBkf\/d88Th6Hsj0rusm3XzifJnmq6c0RGGV8CrclC0SJ1od0k6KMv3xEPJ2HPv1Ixa02nulk1wXyXp0M1lJqUPAAg3GXbI5SSdX+Xq1uf6vXzp8At5vBGY=","wpil_sync_report2_time":"2026-06-17T16:14:09+00:00","metasync_common_robots":"a:1:{s:7:\"noindex\";s:7:\"noindex\";}","metasync_advance_